            "author": {
              "@type": "Person",
              "name": "jerowatts"
            },
            "reviewBody": "Makes an authentic tasting kulfi, which is too sweet for me, even without the sugar. \nAs another review mentions the quantity is on the small side. I had enough for 3 helpings. May have been a mistake converting cups to European measures",
