            "author": {
              "@type": "Person",
              "name": "FRP"
            },
            "reviewBody": "This recipe is so easy and the kulfi came out so delicious! Only downside is that it made about 3 popsicles only, when the recipe yield was 6. Next time I will triple or quadruple the recipe because they were eaten quickly!",
            "datePublished": "2020-09-14T20:41:20.013Z"
          },
