            "author": {
              "@type": "Person",
              "name": "Ingrid Truemper"
            },
            "reviewBody": "Made this for an Indian dinner party and it turned out well. Left out the saffron and didn't add any extra sugar. I froze it in mini-cupcake trays, one metal and one silicone, covered with aluminum foil. The silicone ones turned out more even and also were much easier to pop out of the form.",
